  "description": "Meet the Eskute V200 20\" Electric Dirt Bike — bold design, powerful performance.\n\nWith chunky 20\"x4.0\" one-piece wheels, full suspension with a front fork + rear shock, and a powerful 500W–1300W motor delivering speeds up to 32 MPH, the V200 is built for responsive performance across a variety of riding conditions.\n\nPowered by a 52V 20.8Ah battery, paired with a 7-speed shifter, twist throttle, and versatile electric / pedal-assist / manual modes, the V200 gives riders flexible control for different riding needs.\n\nComplete with a central color LCD display with NFC unlock, front & rear fenders, long saddle, and optional rear rack, the V200 combines comfort, control, and distinctive moped-inspired styling.\n\nBuilt for riders who want powerful performance, versatile handling, and more freedom to explore.",
